            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Draftava 1.3.17

- Add reviewed reconciliation for two independently edited iCloud drafts.
- Verify manifest metadata and Markdown hashes before reconciling.
- Preserve local recovery evidence before any coordinated manifest update.
- Keep overlapping, ambiguous, or unsafe conflicts blocked.

This release does not automatically merge overlapping draft edits.
